WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.130
Look at these dot patterns.

2
00:00:02.180 --> 00:00:04.150
Pattern one has two dots.

3
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:07.690
Each new pattern adds a
column of three more dots.

4
00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:11.090
Two, five, eight, eleven.

5
00:00:11.140 --> 00:00:14.730
Now imagine pattern one
hundred, far along the line.

6
00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:16.470
How many dots will it have?

7
00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:19.930
And can you find out without
drawing every single one?

8
00:00:19.980 --> 00:00:23.390
In this mission, you'll plot points
on a grid using coordinates.

9
00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:28.690
You'll see how y equals m x plus
c describes a straight line.

10
00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:32.130
And you'll find the n-th
term rule of a sequence.

11
00:00:32.180 --> 00:00:36.350
Your mission: find how many dots
are in pattern one hundred.
